EXTERNAL Name(charname)

{Name("Itachi")}
Well hey, that’s pretty good.

{Name("Rana")}
Thanks! I thought you might like a little kick in your drink.

{Name("Itachi")}
So, what has you all riled up like this?

{Name("Rana")}
I really don’t feel like sharing the specifics. But I had something valuable, now I don’t.

{Name("Itachi")}
A long time ago, I had a friend. He wanted to be the mayor of this town. He was crushed by a rock-

{Name("Rana")}
Sorry to hear that-

{Name("Itachi")}
I wasn’t done. He was crushed by a rock, came back as an evil ninja who could teleport.

{Name("Rana")}
Oh wow.

{Name("Itachi")}
Still not done- then I impaled him.

{Name("Rana")}
Ok I get it-

{Name("Itachi")}
Then he stabbed me.

{Name("Rana")}
Oh boy it’s still going.

{Name("Itachi")}
Then we became friends again.

{Name("Rana")}
Oh how sweet-

{Name("Itachi")}
Then he died.

{Name("Rana")}
Yikes…

{Name("Itachi")}
The point is, even though we lose, we should always try to be better.

{Name("Rana")}
Wow that was really dee-

{Name("Itachi")}
Because we don’t know if they’re watching us waiting to stab us if we kill our mutual friend by accident.

{Name("Rana")}
Uhh, thanks.

{Name("Itachi")}
Anyways I better get going, I have a couple late night quests.

{Name("Rana")}
Good luck.

{Name("Itachi")}
I make my own luck.